# Line endings: normalise text in the repo, let Windows check out CRLF.
* text=auto

# Binary assets — never apply line-ending conversion (it corrupts them).
# Git's auto-detection mis-read the print PDFs as text, so be explicit.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary

# Source files are text.
*.html text
*.css  text
*.js   text
*.json text
*.md   text
*.svg  text
